{
 "title": "Explosion",
 "summary": "A stylized explosion: a sphere roughly modelled into a mushroom cloud that grows through a shape key (range down to -1, keyed -1 to 1) after scaling up from nothing; a Voronoi Displace with distance squared and negative strength (a cloud of puffs) whose empty rises with an ease out, grows, and turns with #frame/90; a toon shader (diffuse -> Shader to RGB -> constant ramp from yellow to dark orange, a fresnel mask mixing a hot yellow above 1 into the middle) that is eaten away from the dark parts by keying an inverted ramp's handle (emission/transparent mix, Blended, no transparency overlap), scaled to zero at the end. Around it: a white ring collapsing into the centre, energy lines (one curve object, vector points) drawn in by animating their start and end mapping, and a smoke ring rushing out on a shape key with its own spinning displacement and vanishing smoke shader.",
 "objects": [
  {
   "name": "Explosion",
   "description": "the cloud"
  },
  {
   "name": "SmokeRing",
   "description": "the ring of smoke"
  },
  {
   "name": "EnergyLines",
   "description": "lines rushing in"
  }
 ],
 "expected_result": "Energy lines and a white ring rush into a point, a yellow-orange cartoon explosion puffs up with a smoke ring spreading at its base, then burns away from the dark side.",
